; Anomaly Coop - Lua execution domains of the core group (W4), read by scripts\coop_main.script after
; coop_domains.ltx (same sections and rules, see that file).
;
; The core group's own scripts (coop_core_*) are already "view" through coop_* in coop_domains.ltx: they run on
; every machine and decide by role themselves.
; Stock scripts the core scripts depend on keep their main-file domain: ui_mutant_loot (view, ui_*: the client
; asks the host before its loot window opens), game_statistics / actor_status_thirst / actor_status_sleep
; (owner: the client's own values, kept by the host through coop_core_player), treasure_manager and
; dynamic_news_manager (host: clients get stash content and news from the host through coop_core_world),
; trade_manager (host by default: clients only apply trade profiles through coop_core_world).

; FDDA (Food, Drug and Drink Animations, third party, only if installed): item-use animations of the local
; actor. Without these entries every FDDA callback would be skipped on clients (unknown scripts are host).
; Its HUD animation prefetch is switched off on clients by coop_core_world.
[owner]
enhanced_animations
ea_*
